message: "If you use this artifact, please cite both the paper and this software."
title: "Independent Benchmark and Reviewer-Closure Framework for L-DREA / Gamma G-0"
abstract: >-
  The reproducibility artifact accompanying the L-DREA / Gamma G-0 paper: a deterministic
  reference monitor for autonomous action, and the executed evidence that it works. One command
  regenerates every number, figure, table and document in the repository from executed code.
